UID:6a01f5a7caf93436005b2b85@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba.  Participants will learn to prepa
 re and use the classic ingredients​ including milk\, molasses and tapioc
 a pearls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will 
 also provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\nAl
 lergen awareness notice\nIngredients include:\nA. Sugar\, brown sugar\, mo
 lasses\, milk\, tapioca pearls.\nB. 'Purple Lemonade': butterfly blue pea 
 flowers\, sugar\, honey\, lemon juice & zest\, butterfly blue pea flowers.
LOCATION:Leaside\, Community Room
