 dland Animals Sewing\nFriday\, June 12: Wooden Bookmarks\nFriday\, June 19
 : Polymer Clay Workshop\nFriday\, June 26: DIY Press On Nails\nThursdays i
 n June\, 3:30 - 7 pm\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hub
 s are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where h
 elpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered d
 aily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out 
 more.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fe09f30c0f2c4503f97f0e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
