BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Soccer Movie Night: Bend It Like Beckham
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T200000
UID:6a0608d2f89ee1580052f154@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beautiful game with this soccer/football movie s
 creening of:\nBend It Like Beckham.\nJess Bhamra dreams of playing profess
 ional football\, but her Sikh parents have plans for her: a law degree and
  a marriage. Jules\, a female striker\, spots Jess playing football and in
 vites her to join the women’s team.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0608d2f89ee1580052f154
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
