BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Retirement Planning & Living
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T190000
UID:69f3b295129f1274383bdb21@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's never too late to start thinking about investing! Managin
 g your finances to maximize your retirement years is the goal of retiremen
 t planning. Your retirement strategy should strike a balance between your 
 financial realities\, requirements and wants.\nThis presentation will cove
 r how to plan for retirement\, sources of retirement income and how to pro
 tect yourself from scams\, frauds and financial abuse\nPresented by\nCanad
 ian Investment Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulato
 ry organization that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealers
  and trading activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.\nhttps:/
 /www.ciro.ca/about-ciro\nRegistration encouraged\n. Drop-ins are welcome u
 ntil capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f3b295129f1274383bdb21
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
