 tch workshop. Participants will stitch a Pride flag inspired ringed planet
 . Enjoy our current exhibit\,\nSolar System Stories\n\, and learn a new sk
 ill. This workshop is designed for beginners with no sewing or cross stitc
 h experience. All supplies will be provided.\nThis workshop will be offere
 d on two different dates. Please only register for one.\nInformation Colle
