BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adobe Express
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T153000
UID:6a061beec6a1dc3d00d3bf53@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Adobe Express is a wonderful tool to create professional grap
 hics\, high-impact visuals and giving it's users a level up to increase t
 heir social media presence\, building a personal brand or create professio
 nal materials for business and work.  Users can design social media conte
 nt\, video\, flyers and PDFs.\nAdobe Express is similar to Canva\, another
  web-based design platform.  Full of easy to use templates and libraries 
 of photos and other digital assets to make designing user friendly but not
  sacrificing the quality at the same time.\nThis hands-on class is designe
 d to take you from "blank canvas anxiety" to "design pro" using Adobe’s 
 intuitive\, AI-powered creative suite.  If you're a small business owner o
 r an aspiring and coming creator\, then Adobe Express is for you. Unlike c
 omplex professional software\,  Adobe Express focuses on\nspeed and acce
 ssibility\nwithout sacrificing quality.\nNote:\nNo prior design experience
  is required! Customers are required to create an Adobe account for free a
 head of the class so they can partake in the lesson.\nCreate an Adobe acco
 unt here:\nhttp://account.adobe.com/account\nRegistration is required for 
 this class. You can order free tickets by clicking the link below. Tickets
  will become available one week prior to the class at 9 a.m.\nInformation 
 Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by 
 the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)
 \, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and prog
 ram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the librar
 y handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerl
 ine@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a061beec6a1dc3d00d3bf53
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
