 \nBirding is fun\, easy\, and can be done anywhere--in your own backyard o
 r in a local park. Get tips on how to choose binoculars and field guides
 \, when and where to bird in your neighbourhood\, and how to identify th
 e birds you are likely to find. Find out about clubs and field trips\, bir
