UID:6a0369fedcc3559e3b3be200@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba.  Participants will learn to prepa
 re and use the classic ingredients​ including milk\, molasses and tapioc
 a pearls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will 
 also provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally. Par
 ticipants will also make a purple lemonade using butterfly blue pea flower
 s.\nAllergen notice: This program will involve the use of sugar\, brown s
 ugar\, molasses\, milk\, tapioca pearls\, butterfly blue pea flowers\, hon
 ey\, and lemon.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are
  a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpfu
 l staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily.
  Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
