BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FRESH Movie Saturdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T130000
UID:69c1659f2866a5b48843df0e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In ad
 dition to this\, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visi
 ts Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM.\nWe'll b
 e showing the following films:\nMay 9-Stuart Little\nMay 16-The Jungle Boo
 k(1967)\nMay 23-The Water Horse\nMay 30-Two Brothers\nJune 6 - Lilo&Stitch
 (2025)\nJune 13 - Mufasa:The Lion King\nJune 20 - Despucable Me 4\nJune 27
  - Elio\nJuly 4 - Harold & The Purple Crayon\nJuly 11 - Moana 2\nJuly 18 -
  Angry Birds(2016)\nJuly 25 - The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes\nDrop-ins are
  welcome.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's
  F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Urban Living Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c1659f2866a5b48843df0e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
