BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Let's Talk Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T183000
UID:6a06045ef89ee1580052eead@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Gain confidence in practicing your English-speaking skills\nEx
 pand your networking list and connect with new friends\nEnhance your Knowl
 edge about Canadian life and culture\nLet's Talk Time is a free hybrid (in
 -person and online) program.\nFor registration and further information con
 tact Faiza E. 416-268-3981 or fesho@rexdalewomen.org\nIn partnership wi
 th Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, Rexdale Women's Centre 
 & Toronto Public Library.
