BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Game On! Building Life Skills Through Soccer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T170000
UID:6a0dfa04c6a1dc3d00d4f9c6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 1 hour engaging session with coach and athlete P
 epy Malonga of FOOT-IQ as he shares essential life skills such as leadersh
 ip\, teamwork\, communication\, and decision-making in a fun and relatable
  way through soccer and sports.\nThrough interactive games\, real-life exa
 mples\, and discussion\, participants will connect their love of sport to 
 valuable tools for life success on and off the field.\nAll teens are welco
 me! Drop-in\, no registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub
  service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in t
 he summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious s
 nacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the 
 branch to find out more.
