 scuss nine real and replica fossils in this fascinating hands-on workshop.
  Participants will be entertained and educated\, not just about the fossil
 s themselves\, but the aspects regarding palaeontology that underpin them
 . Concepts include: evolution\, fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life’ (ph
 ylogeny) and — of course — dinosaurs!\nThis is a drop-in program.\nThi
 s program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place f
 or teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always a
 vailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch wit
 h a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Fairview\, In the Youth Hub (3rd floor)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0f41db278f7c2f008ea6f4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
