 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba.  Participants will learn to prepa
 re and use the classic ingredients​ including milk\, molasses and tapioc
 a pearls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will 
 also provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\nFo
 od allergy notice:\nPlease be aware that food will be used in this program
  that include sugar\, brown sugar\, molasses\, milk\, tapioca pearls\, but
 terfly blue pea flowers\, sugar\, honey\, lemon juice and zest. The audien
 ce should be advised that certain food ingredients may cause allergic reac
 tions in some people.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hu
 bs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where 
