 , charms\, and fun accessories\, then attach it onto moving wind-up legs t
 o bring your creation to life. A fun hands-on activity that mixes art\, cr
 eativity\, and simple mechanics. All materials provided. Limited supplies 
 available.\nThis is an in person drop-in program for teens 13 -17.\nThis p
 rogram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for 
 teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always avai
 lable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with
  a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
